#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:113
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"A program called '%1' is slowing down the others on your machine. It may "
"have a bug that is causing this, or it may just be busy.\n"
"Would you like to try to stop the program?"
msgstr ""
"'%1' भनिने कार्यक्रमले तपाईँको मेशिनमा अन्य देखाउदैछ । यसको कारण बग वा यो व्यस्त भएकाले "
"हुनसक्दछ ।\n"
"तपाईँ कार्यक्रम रोक्ने प्रयास गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ ?"

#: NaughtyApplet.cpp:118
msgid "Stop"
